# Godot 4
game/.godot/
game/android/
# `game/export_presets.cfg` is deliberately NOT ignored (ADR-086). It is the
# only place the export configuration lives, so ignoring it — the common
# default — made "works in an exported build" unreproducible by anyone but the
# one machine holding the file. Nothing secret goes in it; signing identities
# and notarisation credentials arrive from the environment.
*.translation

# Godot exports
build/
exports/
*.pck
*.exe
*.x86_64
*.dmg
*.app

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Local scratch
scratch/
*.local

# Agent working files — local only.
#
# Session briefs, slash commands and hook wiring: notes to whoever is holding
# the keyboard, not part of the game or its build. `settings.json` in particular
# carries an absolute path to one machine's checkout, so it was never portable.
#
# `CLAUDE.md` at the repo root is deliberately **not** covered by this. It is the
# working agreement and it is checked in on purpose.
.claude/
